data-json: {"id":"gen-1762429229-Pb8C0rzN5UDOFpL5Lshc","provider":"OpenAI","model":"openai/gpt-5-codex","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1762429230,"choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"role":"assistant","content":"","annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"end_index":0,"start_index":0,"title":"Interview Question: “Describe Yourself in 3 Words” | Indeed.com","url":"https://www.indeed.com/career-advice/interviewing/describe-yourself-three-words-interview-question","content":"There are four broad questions all interviewers are trying to answer when they begin interviewing you. Why you? Why this job? Why our organization? Why this career industry? These questions can be asked in a number of ways, some more challenging to answer than others. And of course, you might also be asked to talk about your weaknesses or a gap in your resume. Leaving you wondering just how to respond. \nI'm Sinéad, and coming up in this video, I have got you covered with concise example answers to eight difficult but very common questions. So take notes and practice these short, direct respons"}},{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"end_index":0,"start_index":0,"title":"Choosing Three Words to Describe Yourself in Interviews","url":"https://topinterview.com/interview-advice/pick-three-words-to-describe-yourself-how-to-answer-it-and-ace-your-next-interview","content":"Protect your data\n\nThis site uses cookies and related technologies for site operation, and analytics as described in our [Privacy Policy](https://topinterview.com/privacy). You may choose to consent to our use of\nthese technologies, reject non-essential technologies, or\nfurther manage your preferences.\n\nAccept All [Cookie Preferences](https://topinterview.com/async-modals/universal/cookie-popup.html)\n\nAlways be prepared to answer this popular interview question.\n\nYou're sitting opposite a poker-faced interviewer. You've already covered the basic questions, and now they're looking to dig deeper"}},{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"end_index":0,"start_index":0,"title":"DESCRIBE YOURSELF in 3 WORDS! (A Brilliant Answer ... - YouTube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fatSsvsMxyY","content":"None\n| view_count: 2,818 views | short_view_count: 2.8K views | num_likes: 23 | num_subscribers: 5K"}},{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"end_index":0,"start_index":0,"title":"How to Answer \"Describe Yourself in 3 Words?\" (Best Examples for ...","url":"https://dailyremote.com/advice/how-to-answer-describe-yourself-in-three-words-examples","content":"I've sat through hundreds of interviews and watched this one question trip up even the most qualified candidates. The request to \"describe yourself in three words\" seems simple but it's actually a make or break moment.\n\nThis isn't just small talk. Your three word response creates an instant impression that can determine whether you make it to the next round or get dropped from consideration.\n\nI've been on both sides of the interview table and know exactly how to turn this tricky question into your secret weapon. Let me show you how to craft an answer that will make hiring managers fight to bri"}},{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"end_index":0,"start_index":0,"title":"How to Answer \"Describe Yourself In 3 Words\" - Final Round AI","url":"https://www.finalroundai.com/blog/describe-yourself-in-3-words","content":"Mastering the question \"Describe Yourself In 3 Words\" is crucial for interview success. This seemingly simple query offers a unique opportunity to showcase your strengths and personality concisely. Understanding how to craft a compelling response can set you apart from other candidates and leave a lasting impression on interviewers. Why You're Getting the Question \"Describe Yourself In 3 Words\"? Assess Self-Awareness: Interviewers want to gauge how well you understand your own strengths and weaknesses. This question helps them see if you have a realistic view of yourself. Evaluate Fit: Employe"}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null,"logprobs":null}]}
