## How to Pass Reasoning Back in OpenRouter Chat Completions

**You pass back the full `reasoning_details` array as a field on the assistant message.**

From the OpenRouter docs and DataCamp tutorial:

```python
{
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": response.choices[0].message.content,
    "tool_calls": response.choices[0].message.tool_calls,  # if any
    "reasoning_details": response.choices[0].message.reasoning_details  # Pass back unmodified
}
```



